 "description": "Linear-groove blocking for breakbeats. TRACK LAYERING (FUNC+3, SETUP) gets a third page, BLOCKS, after the triggering and CHOKES pages. When track A blocks track B and A plays a sequencer trig, B's sequencer trig on the same step is dropped, so only A sounds there. Any track can block any other, lower- or higher-numbered. Blocks are saved with the pattern's kit.",
